    "updated_at": "2023-05-11T04:23:52Z",
    "body": "Another example is to defer permission requests until needed. For example, an IDE that:\r\n\r\n1. pre-populates the OPFS with a folder containing project scaffolding (`src`, `lib`, `package.json`, et al),\r\n1. lets me view and edit those files/directories, and then\r\n1. lets me move them to my local drive once i'm ready to grant write permissions.",
